flowchart TD
    Event[Observed method + route] --> Match[Resolve scoped inventory]
    Match --> Known{Documented?}
    Known -->|Unknown context| Unknown[Preserve unknown; no shadow claim]
    Known -->|Yes| Lifecycle{Deprecated?}
    Lifecycle -->|Yes| Review[Lifecycle review]
    Lifecycle -->|No| Behavior[Endpoint-relative behavioral checks]
    Known -->|No| Candidate[Shadow candidate]
    Candidate --> Probe[Active probe + three baselines]
    Probe --> Distinct{Distinct successful content?}
    Distinct -->|No| Suppress[No confirmed active finding]
    Distinct -->|Yes| Schema[Matched / mismatched / unavailable / truncated]
    Schema --> Finding[Reachability finding with independent confidence]
    Review --> Protected{Requires auth + credentials supplied?}
    Protected -->|Yes| Pair[Compare credential-free content]
    Pair --> Exposure[Equivalent content: authentication exposure]
